  "summary": "GreenSofa public-goods tooling, Ethereum Localism education, and civic-tech bridge work in Taiwan.",
  "description": "GreenSofa has brought funding and public goods tools such as Gitcoin, Giveth and Hypercerts into Taiwan's civic tech scene, working with g0v and local NGOs. It keeps an itemized log of its funding receipts on HackMD, runs a Hypercerts dashboard for local public goods in Taiwan, and hosted an Ethereum Localism gathering with FAB DAO on July 30, 2025.",
